  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Refugee Commission (WRC) Call to Action Partnership meeting 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WRC will provide support for the annual meeting. The goal of the annual meeting is to advance work of the Call to Action by addressing the way GBV is addressed in humanitarian action.
This includes contracting a third party to provide and run a digital platform as well as provide translation (at least French, Arabic, English) and captioning during the
meeting, The WRC will support the Danish Call to Action leadership in the following areas
? Registration and communication, including setup of registration, hosting of event page, pre-event technical support to registrants.
? Event platform and hosting, including set up of event platform, event hosting management during sessions, design and management of polling and interactivity platforms, backup event platforms, pre-event technical support, sound checks and in-meeting support
? Recording and follow-up communications, including event evaluation form.
? Accessibility: Interpretation, including coordination and management of spoken interpretation (at least between English, French and Arabic)
? Accessibility: Caption, including coordination and management of closed captioning.</narrative>
  </description>
